Subject: [PATCH 7/7] xconfig: Fix the filename for GUI settings
Date: Wed, 30 Oct 2013 22:46:20 +0100
Message-Id: <00d4f8fc2c729b1baf723cacd2b5942b032b6784.1383168460.git.yann.morin.1998@free.fr>
In-Reply-To: <cover.1383168460.git.yann.morin.1998@free.fr>
